# vblood-player-death.vrs: a player's death never raises VBloodKilled (fix 62ce215; a player character carries
# VBloodConsumeSource). A tracked spider kills Chaos (.devdie), then a tracked Ungoro (CHAR_Spider_Queen_VBlood -548489519)
# is killed (.devkill): since revenge D30 a tracked V Blood raises nothing either. That a native V Blood still raises
# VBloodKilled is shown by revenge-vblood.vrs (a native Faction_Bandits V Blood).
# Needs: NyarDevTools (.devgo, .devdie, .devkill), no purge cooldown. Wrap the world in dev-snapshot (Chaos gains the V Blood).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 3
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Spider_Forest 1
expect-log spawned CHAR_Spider_Forest timeout=20
wait 3
mark
chat .devdie -581295882 50
expect-log \[DEV DIE\] found=1
expect-no-log trigger: VBloodKilled timeout=10
hold space 1.5
wait 10
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 3
chat .nyar spawn CHAR_Spider_Queen_VBlood 1
expect-log spawned CHAR_Spider_Queen_VBlood timeout=20
wait 4
mark
chat .devkill -548489519 50
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=1
expect-no-log trigger: VBloodKilled timeout=10
wait 2
chat .devkill -581295882 60
